SECURITY & LEGAL ADDENDUM
=========================

This software is provided for EDUCATIONAL PURPOSES ONLY.

AUTHORIZED USE:
- Testing systems you own or have written permission to test
- Authorized penetration testing engagements with proper scope
- Security research and educational demonstrations
- Internal security policy validation and training

UNAUTHORIZED USE VIOLATIONS:

Pakistan:
  PECA 2016 (Prevention of Electronic Crimes Act)
  - Section 3: Unauthorized access to information system (7 years)
  - Section 4: Unauthorized modification (7 years)
  - Section 5: Introducing viruses (7 years)
  - Section 14: Obtaining service through unauthorized access (7 years)
  - Section 16: Hacking (14 years imprisonment + fine)

United States:
  Computer Fraud and Abuse Act (18 U.S.C. § 1030)
  - Unauthorized access: Up to 10 years imprisonment
  - Aggravated damage: Up to 20 years imprisonment
  - Civil damages: Up to $100,000+ per violation

European Union:
  Directive 2013/40/EU (Computer Misuse)
  - Unauthorized system access: Up to 2 years imprisonment
  - Aggravated access: Up to 5 years imprisonment
  - Related offenses: Up to 10 years imprisonment

By using this software, you acknowledge:

1. You have obtained proper legal authorization for any testing
2. You understand the criminal penalties for unauthorized access
3. You accept full legal responsibility for your actions
4. You will comply with all applicable laws in your jurisdiction
5. The developer is not liable for misuse of this software

Responsible Disclosure:
If you discover security vulnerabilities, please report them responsibly
to the developer rather than publicly disclosing them.

Questions? See SECURITY.md or contact the developer.
